# Copy to .env in this directory. Vite reads its own project root, not the repo root.
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines VITE_* into the public client bundle. URLs and flags
# only — never a key, token, or pairing secret.

# WebSocket target for the Mac brain. MUST match a whitelist entry in
# app.json's network permission — a mismatch fails silently (socket never
# opens, no error). Scheme matters too: the Phase-0 gateway is plain ws://.
# When Tailscale is set up, add the ts.net URL to BOTH files.
# Comma-separated candidates, rotated on failure (brain portability):
# VITE_MAC_WS_URL=ws://mac-a.tailnet.ts.net:8787/glasses,ws://mac-b.tailnet.ts.net:8787/glasses
